       AND `the official has reason to believe that the person has the document`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the power is to require "any person whom the Commissioner or inspecting officer has reason to believe has any document"
    ELSE NOTHING

-- s 103(1)(d): "to examine notices and all documents which are required to be kept under the provisions of this Act or any
