      `the notice or document is one mentioned in paragraph (d)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 103(1)(e) the official may make copies of or retain the notice or document` MEANS
    IF `s 103(1) helper: the official is the Commissioner or an inspecting officer` official AND `the notice or document is one mentioned in paragraph (d)`
