GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 107(c) the person is guilty of an offence` MEANS
    IF `the person hindered or obstructed the Commissioner or an inspecting officer in the exercise of the powers under section 103`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the offence is hindering or obstructing the Commissioner or an inspecting officer in the exercise of the powers under section 103
    ELSE NOTHING

-- src:4397 | 107. Any person who —
@ref s 107 (src:4397)
GIVEN `the answer of s 107(a)` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the answer of s 107(b)` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the answer of s 107(c)` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 107 the person is guilty of an offence` MEANS
    IF `the answer of s 107(a)` EQUALS JUST TRUE OR `the answer of s 107(b)` EQUALS JUST TRUE OR `the answer of s 107(c)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
    THEN JUST TRUE
    -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the offence is the conduct in paragraph (a), (b) or (c)
    ELSE NOTHING

-- s 107: the penalty: "a fine not exceeding $5,000 or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding 6 months or to both".
-- src:4397 | 107. Any person who —
-- src:4399 | (a) without reasonable excuse, neglects or refuses to produce
-- src:4400 | any document or article as required under section 103;
-- src:4402 | (b) makes to the Commissioner or an inspecting officer
-- src:4403 | exercising the powers under section 103 a statement,
-- src:4404 | either orally or in writing, which is false in a material
-- src:4405 | particular; or
-- src:4407 | (c) otherwise hinders or obstructs the Commissioner or an
-- src:4408 | inspecting officer in the exercise of the powers under
-- src:4409 | section 103,
-- src:4411 | shall be guilty of an offence and shall be liable on conviction to a fine
-- src:4412 | not exceeding $5,000 or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding
-- src:4413 | 6 months or to both.
@ref s 107 (src:4397-4413)
GIVETH A `Penalty on conviction`
`s 107 the penalty on conviction` MEANS
    `Penalty on conviction` WITH
        `least fine in dollars` IS 0
        `greatest fine in dollars` IS JUST 5000
        `longest imprisonment in months` IS JUST 6
